# ─── Hyperframes video project — heavy outputs (re-generated by scripts) ───
# These are re-created by `npx hyperframes render` and `node scripts/shoot-*.mjs`.
# Keep source markup + capture script in git; ignore rendered binaries and source PNGs.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
